# Approved per-module deviations from the shared gates.
#
# Columns (whitespace-separated): module kind value justification
#   module         module root as discovered, e.g. retry or retry/v2
#   kind           coverage | platforms
#   value          coverage:  integer 0-79 (lowered statement coverage threshold)
#                  platforms: comma-separated GOOS/GOARCH list of the platforms
#                             the module does support, from linux, darwin,
#                             windows x amd64, arm64
#   justification  free text, required; everything after the third column
#
# At most one line per (module, kind). Lines naming a module that does not
# exist make the structure check fail. A platforms restriction must also be
# stated in the module README.
#
# Examples:
# retry       coverage   70                           generated table code is exercised only via fuzzing
# fsnotify    platforms  linux/amd64,linux/arm64      relies on inotify; README states Linux-only support
